Another suggestion for hallucinations:

I never liked the way things continuously change when you hallucinate;
I implemented hallucinate for rogue once, and I simply made each
monster look like another at random (but two of the same kind of monster
could look like two different monsters, i.e. you couldn't tell that all
nymphs looked liked dragons or something).  Hallucination right now is
not very deceptive, but coupling this hallucination effect with flashbacks
would be nasty if there was no message alerting you.  You couldn't be
sure what you were looking at...

